<section id="install">
	<h1>Sections on the base layout</h1>
	<p>A section directly in the page is a centered column at the layout width. Its <code>id</code> is the anchor, and its heading carries the outline.</p>
</section>
<section id="usage">
	<h2>Usage</h2>
	<p>The next section has the same width and the same padding. It is not a landmark, so it takes no name.</p>
</section>
